| Base and shared context | Proposal: Non-generic Gizmo; visibility/rendering/lifecycle. Phase 1: reusable contract. | [Gizmo](../VanillaBuildingExpanded/src/Gizmos/Gizmo.cs) has identity, eligibility, opaque handles and lifecycle/render/hit hooks. [Context carriers](../VanillaBuildingExpanded/src/Gizmos/GizmoContext.cs) provide shared frame identity/dimension and validated double visual rays. Projection data and positioning shapes are Phase 3 work. |
| Typed events and transactions | Proposal: Generic Gizmo<TValue>; Phase 1 setter/baseline/external replacement ordering. | The same Value setter handles owner updates, previews and rollback with default equality. [Base/typed tests](../VanillaBuildingExpanded.Tests/Gizmos/GizmoTests.cs) assert synchronous values/count/order, equal echoes, no-op/changed rollback, cancel-before-replacement and reentrant removal/disposal. Immutable-value expectations are documented in the API and [architecture](./BuildBrushArchitecture.md). |
| Manager and ownership | Proposal: Activation/capture and visibility/lifecycle; Phase 1 priority/depth/insertion contract. | [Manager](../VanillaBuildingExpanded/src/Gizmos/GizmoManager.cs) owns membership and exclusive capture, prioritizes instance-provided handles and quantized depth/insertion across instances, and requires successful rendering in the matching frame. [Manager tests](../VanillaBuildingExpanded.Tests/Gizmos/GizmoManagerTests.cs) cover eligibility, arbitration, removal, dimension/context loss, render failure and teardown; base tests repeat 100 complete/cancel cycles. No native registrations or ruler/config dependencies are introduced. |

